sentences.text:
Ingredients of the offence under Section 406 are:
"(1) a person should have been entrusted with property, or entrusted with dominion over property;
(2) that person should dishonestly misappropriate or convert to his own use that property, or dishonestly use or dispose of that property or wilfully suffer any other person to do so;
(2008) 5 SCC 662 (3) that such misappropriation, conversion, use or disposal should be in violation of any direction of law prescribing the mode in which such trust is to be discharged, or of any legal contract which the person has made, touching the discharge of such trust."
